me standing solemnly beneath the clear sky, forming a dialogue between history and modernity against the backdrop of contemporary skyscrapers. The composition follows the rule of thirds, slightly right-aligned, with the figure occupying the right two-thirds of the frame, leaving ample negative space on the left to enhance spatial depth. Lighting is natural daylight, slanting from the upper left, creating soft contrast between light and shadow; the subject's face and the shoulders of her coat are illuminated, forming warm highlights, while shaded areas add depth. The overall atmosphere is relaxed and comfortable, evoking a sense of leisurely freedom during an urban stroll. The color palette is dominated by earth tones, complemented by denim blue and architectural gray, creating a stable, lively visual experience. The image feels realistic with rich detail—fabric creases, metal railing textures, stone carvings on buildings—all demonstrating the natural beauty and artistic depth of everyday photography. This prompt emphasizes \"realism,\" \"ordinariness,\" and \"atmosphere,\" avoiding excessive embellishment, aiming for a harmonious blend of natural lighting and urban human elements."], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 33, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [381.52752685546875, 265.66082763671875], "pos": [2829.04345703125, 754.2767944335938], "id": 27, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "f2838ed5e59de4d73cde5c98354b87a8d3200190", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.4.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 25}, {"outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "links": [], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["一位短发女性站在城市天台边缘，身着米色风衣，搭配高腰牛仔裤，佩戴玳瑁色太阳镜，嘴角含笑仰望天空，左手轻握银色智能手机，手机通过黑色线缆连接着挂于颈间的黑色便携充电宝。她姿态自然，仿佛在享受都市中的片刻宁静。前景是金属栏杆，略带磨损，与人物形成视觉引导线，将视线引向主体。中景是红砖建筑群，屋顶与墙面在阳光下投下清晰阴影，层次分明。背景是标志性的圆顶建筑——圣保罗大教堂，其古典柱廊与穹顶在晴空下庄严矗立，与现代高楼形成历史与现代的对话。构图采用中景偏右的三分法，人物占据画面右侧三分之二，左侧留白增强空间感。光线为自然日光，从左上方斜射，塑造出柔和明暗对比，人物面部与风衣肩部被照亮，形成温暖的高光区，而阴影部分则加深了立体感。整体氛围轻松惬意，带有一种都市漫步的慵懒与自由，色彩以大地色系为主，辅以牛仔蓝与建筑灰，营造出沉稳而富有生活气息的视觉体验。画面质感真实，细节丰富，如衣料褶皱、金属栏杆纹理、建筑石雕等，无不体现日常摄影的自然美感与艺术深度。此提示词强调“真实感”“日常感”“氛围感”，避免过度修饰，追求自然光影与城市人文的和谐交融。"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 85, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [380.89007568359375, 240.14453125], "pos": [2826.842041015625, 463.05419921875], "id": 12, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "f2838ed5e59de4d73cde5c98354b87a8d3200190", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.4.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 23}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "translation", "links": [33, 86], "label": "translation", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "translation"}], "size": [235.62342834472656, 292.7745666503906], "pos": [2543.1943359375, 539.2000732421875], "widgets_values": ["", 947, "randomize", "force_english"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 83, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "advanced_options"}, "shape": 7, "name": "advanced_options", "label": "advanced_options", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "advanced_options"}], "flags": {}, "id": 26, "type": "RH_Translator", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_Translator"}, "order": 22}, {"mode": 2, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [58], "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}], "size": [326.1434326171875, 364.83477783203125], "pos": [1922.07238